                                "sense_id": "457d4dc2-0d19-368a-9252-d7de361309f2",
                                "text": "In Honolulu, Nancy Peacock, an architect, said her clients increasingly requested “punees,” as daybeds are known in Hawaii — sometimes on the lanai, the covered porch of the house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38c164eb-807e-4e19-9232-2a755f066446",
                                "sense_id": "457d4dc2-0d19-368a-9252-d7de361309f2",
                                "text": "Afterward, Lili‘u and Stevenson found time to talk quietly with each other on the bungalow's lānai."
                            }
